      ],
      "description": "<p>The brass dragon breathes fire in a 80ft Line that deals 12d6 Fire Damage damage (Basic DC 32 Reflex Saving Throw save).</p>\n<p>The dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
